source /home/ikbal/ros2_ws/install/setup.bash
ros2 launch mearm_object_detection mearm_object_detection.launch.py \
  camera_index:=5 \
  show_debug_windows:=true
You should see two OpenCV windows: "Object Spotter" and "Edges".

Step 6: If still no window, override camera index

Try index 4 (the comment in your launch file suggests index 4 is the real RGB camera):


ros2 launch mearm_object_detection mearm_object_detection.launch.py \
  camera_index:=4 \
