Quick Diagnostic Checklist

Run these in order:

Does the node start without "camera open failed"? → If no, your camera_index is wrong.
Are you seeing ROS log output? → If not, the node may be crashing on model/labels load.
Do two OpenCV windows appear? → If no, show_debug_windows is still false or $DISPLAY is missing.
Is the image blank/black? → Camera index points to a non-video device (e.g., IR sensor).
Does cv::waitKey(1) need to be held? → The windows update on each timer tick (10 Hz by default), so move the object to see changes.
